=2 Walkthrough
>Bhaflau Thickets
!Bhaflau Thickets-map2.jpg||Map 2
* Speak with {n:Tateeya} in the **Automaton Workshop** (I-7) in {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} for a cutscene to begin the Mission.
* Speak with {n:Ghatsad} for another cutscene.
** Being in the middle of {q:No Strings Attached|No Strings Attached|No Strings Attached} may prevent you from continuing this Quest. __(verification needed)__
* Head to the {z:Jade Sepulcher}.
** Fastest way is by {p:Home Point} #1 to {z:Bhaflau Thickets} Map 2.
** Another way is to go to {p:Mamool Ja Staging Point} to {z:Bhaflau Thickets} Map 2 and head North.
* Examine the **Ornamental Door** for a cutscene.
* Examine the **Ornamental Door** again to enter the BCNM fight "{M:Tateeya's Worries|Tateeya's Worries|Tateeya's Worries}" against:
** Drakeweaver Hageel Ja (PLD) - 60k HP
** Riftweaver Pomaal Ja (BLU) - 60k HP
** Fistweaver Mufaal Ja (Sahagin MNK) - 60k HP
** Glyphweaver Sikool Ja (BLM). - 100k HP
*** Casts Stun, Thunder V, Thunder VI, Ionohelix II, Thundaja.
**** These will not do much harm to a player in MDT/Magic Evasion gear, but will deal solid damage against trusts.
** {p:Trusts|Trust} may be used in the fight.
** Glyphweaver Sikool Ja's weapon must be broken to win the fight, otherwise he'll remain at 1%.
*** To do this you need to weaponskill as the NM is doing a **melee** attack or very shortly after.
** All foes utilize their {@g:Two-Hour ability|Two-Hour ability} 1-hour abilities.
** All foes can be silenced
** All mobs can be slept
* Head back to {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} and examine **Imperial Whitegate** for the final cutscene and the {@i:Thunder Hammer|22032} {p:Thunder Hammer}.
** **{c=red:Note:}** Do not discard the {@i:Thunder Hammer|22032} {p:Thunder Hammer}. You will need it for a later Mission.

